{"id":"although-however","lv":"b1","n":37,"cat":"clauses","t":"Although, even though, however: dù… nhưng","en":"Although it rained, … · However, …","sum":"Nối hai ý trái ngược. Although / even though (mạnh hơn) + mệnh đề: Although the work is hard, I really like it. Tiếng Việt “tuy… nhưng…” dùng hai từ; tiếng Anh chỉ một — không dùng although … but. Sau although phải là mệnh đề (Although the rain ✗). However = tuy nhiên, mở đầu câu mới, sau dấu chấm, có dấu phẩy ngay sau: She's strict. However, she's always fair. Văn nói: though ở cuối câu (I liked it, though).","forms":[{"f":"although / even though + mệnh đề, + mệnh đề","vi":"Although it was raining, we went out."},{"f":"không dùng although … but","vi":"tuy… nhưng… → chỉ một từ"},{"f":"Câu 1. However, câu 2.","vi":"It was raining. However, we went out."},{"f":"…, though. (cuối câu, văn nói)","vi":"I liked it, though."}],"pts":[{"id":"although-though","name":"although / even though","vi":"Dù… (nhưng): although, even though, though"},{"id":"however","name":"however","vi":"However: nối hai câu đối lập"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":1040}},"bg":"office","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"How was your first week at the new job?","vi":"Tuần đầu ở chỗ làm mới thế nào?","ipa":["haʊ","wɑz","jɔɹ","fɝst","wik","æt","ðə","nu","dʒɑb"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":2.424,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.581],[2,0.764],[3,0.907],[4,1.298],[5,1.532],[6,1.636],[7,1.727],[8,1.923]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Although the work is hard, I really like it.","vi":"Tuy công việc vất vả, tôi vẫn rấ